### Slot State Machine Transitions

Each slot tracks its state via an `std::atomic<uint32_t>` status flag:

```
  ┌─────────┐
  │  EMPTY  │ ◄─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  └────┬────┘                                               │
       │ Atomic FAA / CAS reservation                       │
       ▼                                                    │
 ┌───────────┐                                              │
 │  CLAIMED  │                                              │
 └─────┬─────┘                                              │
       │ Producer begins writing payload                    │
       ▼                                                    │
 ┌───────────┐                                              │
 │  WRITING  │                                              │
 └─────┬─────┘                                              │
       │ CRC32C calculated, payload published               │
       ▼                                                    │
 ┌───────────────────┐                                      │ Reclaimed by flusher
 │  READY_FOR_FLUSH  │                                      │ after wrap-around
 └─────────┬─────────┘                                      │
