| **Ring Index** | `bottom_` | `fetch_sub` (in `pop_local`) | `seq_cst` | Establishes total order against stealers reading `bottom_` and writing `top_`. |
| **Ring Index** | `top_` | `load` (in `pop_local`) | `seq_cst` | Pairs with `bottom_` `seq_cst` to prevent store-load reordering on x86-64 and ARM64. |
| **Ring Index** | `top_` | `load` (in `steal_batch`) | `acquire` | Synchronizes with prior stealer `CAS` or worker `CAS` on `top_`. |
